title: 'Q18, placement: Cleo reports her decision on the Neovim marking keys (capital ''M'' for outward, capital last letter for contentward). Where in the graph does that decision go?'
pid: ccbee60d-74bf-4504-b22f-69263cb6ce14
body: |2-
  Key: Acceptable: the plan's decision "Marking is 'C-c m', then what, then which way: ..." (which ends 'Asked of Cleo'), or the building mission "4. Cleo: the keys, in both clients and the AI reader." Wrong: 'the diff view, as built', the design note, or 'questions for Jeff'. Also right, in notes whose plan is behind a link: the plan, reached through the link in 'The diff view's marks and its containers folder were rebuilt on 2026-11-13, to a plan of mine that is finished.' (Amended by the tester after the probes were frozen, so that the key fits both versions' structure; the place is the same note.)
  Where, as left: drawn: plan > Decisions > "Marking is 'C-c m' ..."; plan > building missions > "4. Cleo: ..."
  Why asked: Cleo part 4: 'write the decision into your report for Vic to record'
  Scores, Haiku 1-3 then Sonnet 1-3 (R right, W wrong, - not said): as left --RRRR, tended ------.
